			<div class="content" id="post-content-1392328">
									

<p>So the description lists this as &quot;a foldable nylon frisbee.&quot; I normally wouldn't care, but since this is supposed to sound official, I thought I should point out that &quot;Frisbee&quot; is a trademarked name, and that the generic term is &quot;flying disc.&quot; Unless it's actually a Frisbee, in which case, it should probably be capitalized.</p>

