			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1511475">
									

<p>But that's like saying the generic term for Kleenex is &quot;tissue&quot; or whatnot. While technically correct, kleenex has also become a generic term for tissue. Same thing with the frisbee&#8230; do you honestly know anyone that calls them &quot;flying discs&quot; if they're not branded Frisbee? Even clinical tone will only go so far.</p>
